Cross-MILA modifies the upstream project by introducing a bidirectional
locality-aware linear cross-modal interaction module, paired RBF alignment and
decorrelation objectives, speaker-independent five-fold evaluation utilities,
additional baselines and ablations, and reproducibility/efficiency tooling.

The original datasets, pretrained HuBERT/BERT weights, and experiment
checkpoints are not redistributed by this repository. Their respective terms
and licenses continue to apply.
